":"O lord of the mountain"}],"gloss":"O lord of the mountain!"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நோதக்கன்றே","parts":[{"text":"நோதக்கன்றே","lemma":"நோதக்கன்றே","gloss":"indeed it is painful"}],"gloss":"indeed it is painful","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காமம்","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"காமம்","gloss":"love"}],"gloss":"love"},{"surface":"யாவதும்","parts":[{"text":"யாவது","lemma":"யாவது","gloss":"whatsoever"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"whatsoever"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நன்றென","parts":[{"text":"நன்று","lemma":"நன்று","gloss":"good"},{"text":"என","lemma":"என","gloss":"as"}],"gloss":"as good"},{"surface":"உணரார்","parts":[{"text":"உணரார்","lemma":"உணரார்","gloss":"those who do not understand"}],"gloss":"those who do not understand"},{"surface":"மாட்டும்","parts":[{"text":"மாட்டும்","lemma":"மாட்டும்","gloss":"even towards"}],"gloss":"even towards","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சென்றே","parts":[{"text":"சென்று","lemma":"செல்","gloss":"having gone"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed having gone"},{"surface":"நிற்கும்","parts":[{"text":"நிற்கும்","lemma":"நில்","gloss":"stands"}],"gloss":"stands"},{"surface":"பெரும்","parts":[{"text":"பெரும்","lemma":"பெருமை","gloss":"great"}],"gloss":"great"},{"surface":"பேதைமைத்தே","parts":[{"text":"பேதைமை","lemma":"பேதைமை","gloss":"foolishness"},{"text":"து","lemma":"து","gloss":"it is of"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed it is of foolishness"}]}],"literal":"On the top of the big mountain, the long white waterfall, / resounding like the drum of the experienced musicians, / descends through the mountain side, O lord of the shining mountain! / Indeed it is painful, love, whatsoever, / even towards those who do not understand it as good, / indeed going and persisting, it is of great foolishness.","translation":"O lord of the shining mountain, where the long white waterfall on the high peak descends roaring like the drums of experienced musicians! Love is indeed painful. It is of great foolishness, for it goes and persists even towards those who do not understand its goodness.","modern":"பெரிய மலையின் உச்சியிலிருந்து விழுகின்ற நீண்ட வெண்மையான அருவி, அனுபவம் வாய்ந்த கூத்தர்களின் முழவு வாத்தியத்தின் ஒலியைப் போல முழங்கி, மலைப்பக்கத்தே இறங்கி வரும் ஒளிரும் மலைநாடனே! காமம் என்பது மிகவும் துன்பம் தருவதாகும். அதன் நன்மையை உணராதவர்களிடத்தும் அது சென்று நிலைத்து நிற்கும் பெரும் பேதைமை உடையது.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the hero's friend (pāṅkaṉ) to the hero. Seeing the hero suffering deeply from his love for the heroine, the friend remarks on the painful nature of desire. He addresses the hero as the lord of the shining mountain, where a loud, white waterfall echoes like the drums of skilled musicians. This image of the loud, unstoppable waterfall represents the overwhelming and uncontrollable nature of the hero's passion. The friend laments that love is a foolish thing because it goes and clings even to those who do not appreciate or understand its worth. The key words are 'வெற்ப' (lord of the mountain), 'காமம்' (love), and 'பேதைமைத்தே' (it is of foolishness).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.2],[1.2,1.6],[1.68,2.0],[2.0,3.1],[3.1,3.3],[3.3,3.8],[3.8,4.37],[4.37,5.7],[5.7,5.9],[5.9,6.8],[6.8,6.94],[6.97,7.38],[7.38,7.8],[7.8,8.3],[8.3,8.6],[8.6,9.45],[9.45,10.3],[10.3,10.7],[10.7,11.9],[11.9,12.1],[12.1,12.4],[12.4,13.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,1.1],[1.1,1.72],[1.72,2.0],[2.0,3.2],[3.2,3.5],[3.5,3.9],[3.9,4.5],[4.5,5.15],[5.15,5.8],[5.8,6.5],[6.5,6.85],[6.85,7.2],[7.2,7.48],[8.3,8.9],[8.9,9.1],[9.1,9.85],[9.85,10.6],[10.6,11.1],[11.1,11.61],[11.61,12.3],[12.3,12.7],[12.85,13.6]]},"sync":[[["பெருவரை","great mountain"]],[["மிசையது","on the top of"]],[["நெடுவெள்ளருவி","long white waterfall"]],[["நெடுவெள்ளருவி","long white waterfall"]],[["முதுவாய்","experienced-mouthed"]],[["கோடியர்","musicians"]],[["முழவின்","like the drum"]],[["ததும்பி","resounding"]],[["சிலம்பின்","through the mountain side"]],[["இழிதரும்","descending"]],[["இலங்குமலை","shining mountain"]],[["வெற்ப","O lord of the mountain!"]],[["நோதக்கன்றே","indeed it is painful"]],[["நோதக்கன்றே","indeed it is painful"]],[["காமம்","love"]],[["யாவதும்","whatsoever"]],[["நன்றென","as good"]],[["உணரார்","those who do not understand"]],[["மாட்டும்","even towards"]],[["சென்றே","indeed having gone"]],[["நிற்கும்","stands"]],[["பெரும்","great"],["பேதைமைத்தே","indeed it is of foolishness"]],[["பேதைமைத்தே","indeed it is of foolishness"]]]}